  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; <SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">안녕하세요</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">늘 눈도장만으로 여러 선생님들의 보물 같은 자료를 받고만 있다가 처음으로 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이렇게 긴 글을 올립니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">아래글 선생님께서 마침 저와 비슷한 고민을 하고 계시기에..</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고민 끝에 여러 선생님들께 부끄럽게도 제 수업방식을 공개합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모둠수업은 정말 오랜만에 하는 것이라 고민이 많습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">&nbsp; 저는 </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년만 수업을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">6-7</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 하다가 오랜만에 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년수업을 하게 되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가장 당황스러운 것은 아이들이 과학시간의 강의식 수업에 전혀 익숙하지 않다는 점이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">그래서 고민 끝에 첫 시간부터 모둠수업의 틀을 짜고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">다음은 제가 하고 있는 모둠수업 방식입니다</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">모둠은 중간고사까지</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기말</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 이렇게 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번을 바꿀 계획입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">많은 조언 부탁드립니다.^^</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단원 과학이란 무엇일까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">첫 시간</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모둠 세우기부터 시작했습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교실에서 수업을 하기 때문에 앉은자리를 이용하여 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명씩 묶어 교실에서도 손쉽게 책상을 옮기는 방법으로 모둠형성을 했습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">역할분담도 하였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이끔이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기록이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지킴이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">꼼꼼이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">각 모둠의 역할을 돌아가며 익히고 서로 얼굴 익히기를 위해 각 역할을 맡은 친구들의 특징과 장점을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">적어보게 하였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">그리고 다 완성된 표를 가지고 나오는 모둠은 선착순 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모둠까지 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">칭찬도장을 찍어줍니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">돌아가면서 각 모둠의 이끔이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기록이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지킴이</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">꼼꼼이를 확인하고 랜덤으로 각각의 역할을 물어봅니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"> </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수업을 마치기 전 각 모둠에서 작성한 표를 모아서 걷습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이때 각 모둠에서 정한 역할을 이용합니다</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">마지막으로 과학도우미 한사람을 정합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">둘째시간 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&#8211; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과학이란 무엇일까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">첫 시간에 정한 모둠별로 앉은 상태로 수업을 시작합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지난시간에 했던 모둠의 역할과 수업신호를 연습합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.( </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">침묵신호</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">집중신호</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">활동</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과학이란 무엇일까를 설명하기 전 일상생활 속에서 우리가 하는 과학관련 활동의 예를 보여준 후 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">A4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">용지를 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1/4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 접게 한 후 돌아가면서 예를 적어보게 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">펜 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개와 종이 한장에 돌아가면서 쓰기를 하다보면 아이들이 바쁘게 움직입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세 사람이 예를 말하고 한사람이 적는 것 보다 훨씬 집중도가 높아지는 것 같습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이때 시간은 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분 정도 짧게 줍니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">각 모둠의 기록이들이 번갈아가며 일어나 자기모둠에서 나온 예들을 발표합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다른 모둠들은 들으면서 자기모둠에서 같은 내용이 나오면 하나씩 지워갑니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">마지막 모둠까지 다 발표한 후 가장 지워지지 않은 예를 갖고 있는 모둠을 찾아 다시 발표해 보게 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">활동</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과학적인 활동의 예에 관한 그림과 영상을 보여준 후 공통점을 찾게 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">활동</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다양한 사진으로 과학과 비 과학의 예를 보여주어 차이점을 찾게 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">여기까지 오면 아이들이 과학의 정의를 대충 짐작합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">남은시간은 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">PPT</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 이용하여 내용을 정리합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다음시간은 과학적의 탐구방법에 대한 공부를 할 차례임을 알려주고 자유탐구라는 것을 잠깐 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">언급한 후 마칩니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">여기까지 제가 하고 있는 수업입니다. 첨부파일은 과학적인 활동의 예를 보여줄 때 사용했던 영상입니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">^^;; 동영상파일은 저작권때문에 올리지 못하는군요.<SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">조선미녀삼총사 라는 영화에서 잘라낸 부분입니다.</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
